# Delighted Halfling: "{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a legendary spell" (CR 106.6). On
# turn 3 its restricted {R} is not spent on a Lightning Bolt (the Bolt is paid with a Mox Ruby and the restricted {R} stays in the
# pool) but casts Ragavan, a legendary creature (the positive control). Its other ability, "{T}: Add {C}", has no restriction: on turn 5 the {C} pays for a Sol Ring.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Delighted Halfling
Lightning Bolt
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Sol Ring
Mox Ruby
Forest
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delighted Halfling.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Delighted Halfling.Activate(Ability: any color; Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R} (LegendarySpells, CantBeCountered)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 17
? Bot1.Mana = {R} (LegendarySpells, CantBeCountered)
Bot1.Hand.Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Delighted Halfling.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {C})
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Delighted Halfling; Mox Ruby; Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer; Sol Ring
